  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞３楼　摊位街\n　“半生不熟厨房”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们聚在一起……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 67 08}哟！\n辛苦了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 62 0B}我们正打算去找你。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}大家都到齐了，\n正在登顶前鼓舞士气。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 0A}不过，也不用太紧张。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}只要像之前一样\n继续努力就好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 11 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2B 09}嗯。\n一定能救出来的。\n无论玲……还是善。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9A 08}好嘞！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那就先填饱肚子吧。\n……虽然还是老地方。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CA 0A}也要和这里的祭典小吃\n告别了呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这么一想，有点可惜……\n……好像也没那么可惜？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}一直吃同样的东西，\n当然会腻啦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}一开始我还挺高兴的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}因为祭典的小吃，\n总觉得有点令人向往……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D5 0C}糖苹果也好，棉花糖也好，\n偶尔才能吃到，才觉得好吃。\n天天吃哪还有什么稀罕的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这么一来，真想尽快结束战斗，\n吃到真次郎亲手做的饭啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 03 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A9 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这场漫长的文化祭结束后，\n我们大概又会回到平常的生活吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}然后，为了庆祝回归日常，\n再办场派对……吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 0A}呵呵……感觉有点奇妙呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}真期待庆功宴啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0132",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}啊！\n文化祭结束后，那就是后夜祭了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 68 0B}祭典之后还有祭典……\n各位真是很喜欢祭典呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:15:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}既然如此，不如每天都过祭典？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}好主意{F5 47 02 01 03 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:16:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}肯定会腻{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
