 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 13 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 90 11}不过，每天都能吃到真次郎的料理，\n倒是很诱人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_270.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
